        "problem": "The maximum-version expression can mark multiple rows as most recent for the same template.",
        "about": "data",
        "evidence_in_work": "(version = MAX(version) OVER (PARTITION BY id)) AS is_most_recent_version",
        "source": "One row per email_template_id (most recent version only)",
